
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Laboratoire Saint-Flavien — Notes de terrain & Recherche Avancée</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f6f8fa;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #24292f;
            --text-muted: #57606a;
            --accent-red: #cf222e;
            --border-color: #d0d7de;
            --btn-bg: #0969da;
            --btn-hover: #0856b3;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #1f2328;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 24px 0;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-red);
        }

        .header-content {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .blog-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .blog-tagline {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #8c959f;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 32px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        article {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 36px 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(31, 35, 40, 0.05);
        }

        .post-header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.85rem;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        }

        .post-meta {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .badge-censored {
            background-color: #ffebe9;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        /* TEXTE CACHÉ PAR COULEUR : révélé en surlignant à la souris */
        .hidden-spoiler {
            color: var(--card-bg); /* Texte blanc sur fond blanc */
            user-select: all;
        }

        .hidden-spoiler::selection {
            background: #24292f;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* BLOC ENTIÈREMENT DISSIMULÉ : accessible uniquement via F12 / Inspecter l'élément */
        #secret-manifest-vault {
            display: none;
            background-color: #f6f8fa;
            border: 2px dashed var(--accent-red);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 30px 0 10px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn-download {
            background-color: var(--accent-red);
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .notice-box {
            background-color: #fff8c5;
            border-left: 4px solid #9a6700;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        footer {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 40px auto 30px auto;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="header-content">
            <div>
                <div class="blog-title">Laboratoire Saint-Flavien — Notes & Recherches</div>
                <div class="blog-tagline">Carnet d'investigation — Dr. Ackeurh</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <article>
            <div class="post-header">
                <span class="badge-censored">FICHIER PURGÉ PAR LE PROTOCOLE GOUVERNEMENTAL</span>
